OL,5,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,6,     FEdith Bowman presents a showcase
OL,7,     Fof screen music favourites. This
OL,8,     Fweek, Composer and conductor
OL,9,     FRupert Gregson-Williams discuss
OL,10,     Fhis brand new score to Practical
OL,11,     FMagic 2.
OL,12,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,13,     FJess Gillam is joined by American
OL,14,     Fpianist Simone Dinnerstein for a
OL,15,     Flistening party, including music
OL,16,     Fby Charles Ives, Michael
OL,17,     FPraetorius and Bob Dylan.
