OL,5,G1800 Opera on 3
OL,6,     FLisette Oropesa stars as Elvira in
OL,7,     FBellini's bel canto masterpiece
OL,8,     Ffrom The Royal Opera, where love,
OL,9,     Floyalty and civil war drive her to
OL,10,     Fthe brink of despair and
OL,11,     Fheartbreak.
OL,12,G2130 Music Planet
OL,13,     FLopa Kothari presents folk and
OL,14,     Froots-based music from around the
OL,15,     Fworld, including tracks from sitar
OL,16,     Fvirtuoso Jasdeep Singh Degun and
OL,17,     Fthe Bulgarian National Radio Folk
OL,18,     FOrchestra.
